  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">UPSSSC Junior Assistant Revised Answer Key 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-13T16:59:30+05:30\">June 13, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">4:59 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in/\"><strong>Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Service Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</strong></a>, has released the<strong> Revised Answer Key </strong>on its\u00a0<strong>official website</strong> for the Recruitment of <strong>Junior Assistant\u00a0Examination 2025.</strong> The exam was conducted on<strong> 01 February 2026</strong>, and the last date to submit the application form was\u00a0<strong data-end=\"250\" data-start=\"230\">22 January 2025</strong>. Candidates can check their <strong>Revised Answer Key</strong>\u00a0using\u00a0their\u00a0<strong data-end=\"362\" data-start=\"302\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>\u00a0by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.\u00a0<strong>(<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advt No. : 12-Exam/2024</span>)</strong></span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n        .social-button {\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\